## Third-party model licenses

Saga's source code is MIT licensed. The ML models Saga uses are NOT covered
by this license — they are downloaded separately and have their own terms:

- **NVIDIA Canary-1b-v2** (default ASR engine) — CC BY 4.0. Commercial use OK
  with attribution. Hosted at https://huggingface.co/nvidia/canary-1b-v2.
  CoreML conversion in https://github.com/Parthee-Vijaya/canary-coreml.

- **syv.ai Hviske-v3** (optional Danish premium engine) — CC BY-NC 4.0.
  **Non-commercial use only.** When Saga downloads this model on your behalf,
  you accept these terms via an in-app license modal. For commercial use,
  contact mads@syv.ai. Hosted at https://huggingface.co/syvai/hviske-v3.

- **Apple Speech.framework** (fallback for languages not covered by Canary)
  — Apple Software License (built into macOS).

- **WhisperKit** (Argmax, used internally for Hviske inference) — MIT.

- **Sparkle** (used for auto-update) — MIT.

See Saga's About tab for the live license disclosure UI.
